## Introduction to Appian <a name="introduction"></a>

### What is Appian?
Appian is a low-code/no-code platform for rapidly building applications and automating business processes. It enables enterprises to design, deploy, and manage applications without extensive coding.

### Key Features
- **Low-Code Development**: Minimal hand-coding required
- **Business Process Management (BPM)**: Automate complex workflows
- **Rapid Application Development**: Fast time-to-market
- **Integration Capabilities**: Connect to any system
- **User-Friendly Interface**: Drag-and-drop development
- **Scalability**: Enterprise-grade infrastructure

### Use Cases
- Business Process Automation
- Case Management
- Customer Service Portals
- Supply Chain Management
- HR & Payroll Applications
- Financial Services Applications
- Intelligent Document Processing

