Theory:
- Examine variable values during execution
- Set breakpoints
- Print debug information

SAIL Debug:
a!textDisplayField(
  label: "DEBUG - Current Values",
  value: {
    "Amount: " & ri!amount,
    "Status: " & ri!status,
    "User: " & user.firstName & " " & user.lastName
  }
)
Available in dev mode, hidden in production

Technique 3: Error Message Tracking
Theory:
- Capture detailed error information
- Store for analysis
- Enable root cause analysis

Process Variable: errorLog
Type: Array of Maps
Structure: {timestamp, activity, errorMessage, status}
Usage: Append errors as they occur
Analysis: Review log after process completes
```

