   - Load to Appian
   - Monitor performance
   - Log all operations

4. Validation
   - Record counts match
   - Key metrics verified
   - Calculations correct
   - No data loss

5. Cutover
   - Deactivate legacy system
   - Point users to Appian
   - Monitor performance
   - Handle issues

Phase 5: Post-Migration (Ongoing)

1. Reconciliation
   - Compare legacy vs Appian
   - Monthly audits
   - Document differences
   - Adjust as needed

2. Data Cleanup
   - Remove duplicates
   - Standardize values
   - Archive old system
   - Optimize database

Implementation Considerations:

1. Data Mapping
   Legacy Table: Customer
   ├─ CUST_ID → customerID
   ├─ CUST_NAME → customerName
   ├─ CUST_EMAIL → email
   └─ CUST_ACTIVE → status

   Appian Record: Customer
   ├─ customerID (Link from legacy reference)
   ├─ customerName (Direct)
   ├─ email (Validate format)
   └─ status (Map: Y→Active, N→Inactive)

2. Handling Gaps
   - Legacy has data, Appian doesn't
     Solution: Create placeholder/null
   - Appian requires data, legacy doesn't
     Solution: Generate default/current
   - Data type mismatch
     Solution: Convert (e.g., string to number)

3. Orphaned Records
   Problem: Customer with no company reference
   Solution: 
     - Create default company
     - Flag for manual review
     - Create exception task

4. Performance Optimization
   - Batch loading (1000 records)
   - Disable validations temporarily
   - Disable calculations
   - Re-enable post-load
   - Index creation

5. Validation Script
   ```
   SELECT COUNT(*) AS legacy_count FROM legacy.customer;
   SELECT COUNT(*) AS appian_count FROM appian.customer;
   
   if (legacy_count = appian_count) then
     Status: SUCCESS
   else
     Status: FAILURE
     Investigate differences
   ```

6. Rollback Plan
   - Keep legacy system accessible for 1 month
   - Maintain backup database
   - Document all changes
   - Enable quick restore if needed

Timeline Example:
Week 1-2: Planning
Week 3-4: Preparation
Week 5-6: Pilot
Week 7: Full Migration
Week 8+: Post-Migration Support
